#: processes/sdlc/saturation-meta-merge.bpmn:22
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A session that pushes to a repository in scope. Holds pushes, merges, run cancels and re-runs there from the hold until `meta-merge done`, and names the head it wants merged for a PR it owns."
msgstr ""

#: processes/sdlc/saturation-meta-merge.bpmn:58
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "A sibling that owns a PR in the batch names the head it wants merged."
msgstr ""

